{"title":"Linen sack","sourceTitle":"Linen sack/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Linen_sack/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Leinensack (44% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Linen_sack\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Linen sack (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Linen_sack/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Saco de Tela de Lino (56% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Linen_sack/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Sac en lin (56% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Linen_sack/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Полотняный мешок (56% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Linen_sack/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"亚麻布袋 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Linen sack</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Linensack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Linensack.png/100px-Linensack.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Linensack.png/150px-Linensack.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b9/Linensack.png/200px-Linensack.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Material</b>\n</td>\n<td>Flax and linen\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><i>Veja também: <a href=\"/Containers#Portable_Containers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Containers\">Recipientes Portáteis</a></i> \n</p><p>Um <b>Saco de linho </b> é um <a href=\"/Containers#Bags\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Containers\">bolsa</a> que fornece 5 slots de inventário extras, para um máximo de 20 com 4 equipados. Ele pode ser obtido através da criação, comércio e destruição de vasos rachados.\n</p><p>Enquanto equipado, o saco de linho não é exibido no modelo do Jogador.\n</p><p><span id=\"Crafting\"></span>\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Artesanato\">Artesanato</span></h1>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Um saco de linho pode ser criado na grau de artesanato com um fio de linho colocado acima de um linho.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r429685\">.mw-parser-output .gridItem{width:50px;height:50px;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output .gridItemNumber{bottom:4px;right:4px;position:absolute;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;font-size:21px;line-height:17px;text-align:right;color:white}</style><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<div style=\"width:174px; heig